  "scope": [
    "Generated guest ACPI enumerates VNET at 0xf0002000, GSI 18, UID 2. AML roundtrip validation passed; that AML implementation is unchanged from the focused revision.",
    "Linux PID 1 verifies eth0 MAC 52:54:00:12:34:56, raises the interface, sends a 42-byte ARP request and compares all 42 reply protocol bytes under a 20-second receive bound. Ethernet padding is allowed.",
    "Both Intel cold boots passed guest packet, console, userspace and block checks. The full-disk comparison also passed after write/fsync and a fresh platform boot.",
    "Both NIC captures show the broadcast request for 10.0.2.2 from 10.0.2.15 and a reply from gateway MAC 52:55:0a:00:02:02 to the guest MAC.",
    "A PCI raw-send admission regression test failed before the IRQ guard correction and passed afterward. Host admission tests omit device I/O; Intel boot proofs supply that evidence.",
    "This does not qualify IP configuration, DHCP, SSH, Internet connectivity, sustained throughput, receive latency, multiple guests or the final Debian baseline."
